WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.720
Long words are built from parts you already know.

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:07.970
Find the part, and spell it the same way every time.

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:08.870
Portable:

00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:10.420
port, able.

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:11.390
Spectator:

00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:13.640
spect, a, tor.

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:19.360
The part never changes its spelling, even when the word around it does.
